  "BundleArrangeUndoOut": {
    "description": "What one undo restored, and whether the project it created went with it.\n\n``project_removed`` is False when membership changed after the arrange: the tree\nis restored, the project is left where it is, and the response says so.\n``members_removed`` counts the memberships the undo actually dropped: the rows\nthe ledger snapshotted as added, never a guess.",
    "properties": {
      "arrange_id": {
        "title": "Arrange Id",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "key": {
        "title": "Key",
        "type": "string"
